              },
              {
                "SegmentId": "f59236ee-88ad-4256-a53f-60efaf64877e"
              },
              {
                "SegmentId": "9ac5c3e3-7412-49cb-be9d-7dea7e9007ac"
              }
            ],
            "SummarizedSegment": "The patient presents for follow-up regarding anxiety and work-related stress."
          },
          {
            "EvidenceLinks": [
              {
                "SegmentId": "e008cda2-d39b-4d37-a174-e55f1fc44279"
              },
              {
                "SegmentId": "f59236ee-88ad-4256-a53f-60efaf64877e"
              },
              {
                "SegmentId": "9ac5c3e3-7412-49cb-be9d-7dea7e9007ac"
              }
            ],
            "SummarizedSegment": "They report an uneven week since the last visit but have implemented some of the strategies discussed.\n"
          },
          {
            "EvidenceLinks": [
              {
                "SegmentId": "dd0698b8-a823-4fd1-b125-251035ae304b"
              },
              {
                "SegmentId": "83e21260-5676-4e52-9400-9e8c211b7519"
              }
            ],
            "SummarizedSegment": "The patient describes a specific work-related incident on Tuesday where their supervisor asked for a clearer timeline on two cases."
          },
          {
            "EvidenceLinks": [
              {
                "SegmentId": "b2b8d282-e53f-42b7-a01e-5cbacb612b1f"
              },
              {
                "SegmentId": "9a3a863c-3a01-4069-8c65-8d1dcd39bd48"
              },
              {
                "SegmentId": "f3917f22-5f4c-4240-83cc-6c3397ec5cc3"
              }
            ],
            "SummarizedSegment": "Initially, the patient felt their shoulders tense up and experienced chest tightness and held their breath."
          },
          {
            "EvidenceLinks": [
              {
                "SegmentId": "b2b8d282-e53f-42b7-a01e-5cbacb612b1f"
              }
            ],
            "SummarizedSegment": "They had the thought that their supervisor could tell they had not been on top of the work."
          },
          {
            "EvidenceLinks": [
              {
                "SegmentId": "53aa5e88-5918-43b9-87c5-fb2382462735"
              },
              {
                "SegmentId": "45f00d53-fa5e-4bc9-ab1a-99172bb4d596"
              },
              {
                "SegmentId": "e7027508-8d8b-4580-8b71-e5f30bc622ca"
              }
            ],
            "SummarizedSegment": "The patient almost said they could have everything done by the next morning but remembered to treat the moment as an observation rather than a test."
          },
          {
            "EvidenceLinks": [
              {
                "SegmentId": "53aa5e88-5918-43b9-87c5-fb2382462735"
              },
              {
                "SegmentId": "45f00d53-fa5e-4bc9-ab1a-99172bb4d596"
              },
              {
                "SegmentId": "e7027508-8d8b-4580-8b71-e5f30bc622ca"
              }
            ],
            "SummarizedSegment": "They told the supervisor they would check the files and send a realistic timeline by the end of the day."
          },
          {
            "EvidenceLinks": [
              {
                "SegmentId": "06c1e290-f120-4b2a-8923-90bc12b80a2c"
              },
              {
                "SegmentId": "719cc4a0-e772-4f7e-8e8b-a0582ae6336c"
              }
            ],
            "SummarizedSegment": "The patient felt terrible for about 10 minutes after the interaction and still felt embarrassed, as if they had revealed they needed time."
          },
          {
            "EvidenceLinks": [
              {
                "SegmentId": "e7027508-8d8b-4580-8b71-e5f30bc622ca"
              },
              {
                "SegmentId": "06c1e290-f120-4b2a-8923-90bc12b80a2c"
              },
              {
                "SegmentId": "75b6e2b1-72ac-4ff1-97bd-bdf1659ec7be"
              },
              {
                "SegmentId": "f92c2e29-efa4-40e7-aba7-d581919622ac"
              },
              {
                "SegmentId": "8dfd5913-a4b9-4059-85d8-73ce57f860d7"
              }
            ],
            "SummarizedSegment": "However, the supervisor responded positively, and the patient sent the timeline with an extra day on one case without any negative consequences."
          },
          {
            "EvidenceLinks": [
              {
                "SegmentId": "258f9cff-0ecc-474d-b8ac-97659740b346"
              },
              {
                "SegmentId": "74e2ea46-f8f6-44e2-9c7e-6874c7df9c1b"
              },
              {
                "SegmentId": "8d877966-91ae-4435-9bc7-7c33d21b3d86"
              }
            ],
            "SummarizedSegment": "The patient notes that asking for time did not make them look incapable, though they do not fully believe the opposite yet.\n"
          },
          {
            "EvidenceLinks": [
              {
                "SegmentId": "d173761b-6301-49ed-876e-c6fd7c0f2b35"
              },
              {
                "SegmentId": "3ee8e2fa-f766-4240-9131-3c531bd56675"
              },
              {
                "SegmentId": "f327357e-0cbb-429f-aee4-883cfc598d72"
              }
            ],
            "SummarizedSegment": "The patient also completed the Saturday walk with Nora, walking by the river for about half an hour."
          },
          {
            "EvidenceLinks": [
              {
                "SegmentId": "29857add-71f2-4cde-b2c6-d4ae4df760fb"
              }
            ],
            "SummarizedSegment": "Initially, they kept reaching for their phone but eventually left it in their pocket."
          },
          {
            "EvidenceLinks": [
              {
                "SegmentId": "fccc979d-c342-470f-87cb-2c2dd36b7079"
              }
            ],
            "SummarizedSegment": "The patient felt calmer afterward but then felt guilty for enjoying the walk while work was waiting."
          },
          {
            "EvidenceLinks": [
              {
                "SegmentId": "51c24f48-f315-44e9-aa9c-c21cfbbed9c2"
              },
              {
                "SegmentId": "7c952a1d-74c7-4a01-91bf-46a4353de920"
              }
            ],
            "SummarizedSegment": "They describe a belief that rest only counts if everything is finished, which means it never counts because there is always something unfinished."
          },
          {
            "EvidenceLinks": [
              {
                "SegmentId": "e25c31d9-219d-45cc-86a8-d785e8ece6d5"
              },
              {
                "SegmentId": "d1f50242-490b-45ef-a7cf-74d5d0af4910"
              },
              {
                "SegmentId": "dde42d50-fa96-4b34-9667-89736081fd55"
              }
            ],
            "SummarizedSegment": "The patient reports that being hard on themselves has been a long-standing pattern since school, where they would work longer when worried."
          },
          {
            "EvidenceLinks": [
              {
                "SegmentId": "a7910e18-60d2-48c6-ad00-a753867a63ec"
              }
            ],
            "SummarizedSegment": "This strategy previously paid off but no longer feels effective."
          },
          {
            "EvidenceLinks": [
              {
                "SegmentId": "4d539942-b759-4166-9d44-31f84fa7fec4"
              },
              {
                "SegmentId": "8f13bf75-9605-401f-9278-2b5ead8914b8"
              }
            ],
            "SummarizedSegment": "The patient expresses concern about losing their sense of responsibility and caring about work if they stop being hard on themselves."
          },
          {
            "EvidenceLinks": [
              {
                "SegmentId": "83d3d849-a4e7-45fc-bf11-7acdbb3077b5"
              },
              {
                "SegmentId": "ccc37034-1183-43fc-834b-fb16e7cff71d"
              },
              {
                "SegmentId": "b7df0e48-746b-4942-a103-5f864237ab84"
              }
            ],
            "SummarizedSegment": "They note that when they are not under pressure, they tend to overcorrect by answering messages too quickly and offering to take on tasks before being asked, but they do not trust themselves to stay responsible without the pressure.\n"
          },
          {
            "EvidenceLinks": [
              {
                "SegmentId": "732e053d-da78-4ed1-9a37-912bb941afb3"
              }
            ],
            "SummarizedSegment": "The patient reports that dark thoughts have been less intense this week."
          },
          {
            "EvidenceLinks": [
              {
                "SegmentId": "bf93373c-36f4-4c5c-902a-1cd77faa83f3"
              },
              {
                "SegmentId": "7ecc2fd4-fb39-43ff-bec4-1ad9ed609c43"
              },
              {
                "SegmentId": "0b092b7b-c1f9-414d-8b08-f338149e4210"
              }
            ],
            "SummarizedSegment": "They experienced one episode after receiving a late-night work email, feeling like they wanted to disappear for a minute but did not feel like they would act on it."
          },
          {
            "EvidenceLinks": [
              {
                "SegmentId": "bf93373c-36f4-4c5c-902a-1cd77faa83f3"
              },
              {
                "SegmentId": "7ecc2fd4-fb39-43ff-bec4-1ad9ed609c43"
              },
              {
                "SegmentId": "0b092b7b-c1f9-414d-8b08-f338149e4210"
              }
            ],
            "SummarizedSegment": "The patient told Nora they were having a hard moment and they watched something together."
          },
          {
            "EvidenceLinks": [
              {
                "SegmentId": "fcedf57f-d866-4382-ba92-e3159fb51888"
              },
              {
                "SegmentId": "6cdda9e2-ac53-41f1-bd1b-54f7950535e8"
              },
              {
                "SegmentId": "b4d7b912-c8af-4b0f-b21b-fd25f368cf71"
              }
            ],
            "SummarizedSegment": "They deny any plan or intention to harm themselves today."
          },
          {
            "EvidenceLinks": [
              {
                "SegmentId": "fcedf57f-d866-4382-ba92-e3159fb51888"
              },
              {
                "SegmentId": "6cdda9e2-ac53-41f1-bd1b-54f7950535e8"
              },
              {
                "SegmentId": "b4d7b912-c8af-4b0f-b21b-fd25f368cf71"
              }
            ],
            "SummarizedSegment": "The patient reports feeling tired but not in danger.\n"
          },
          {
            "EvidenceLinks": [
              {
                "SegmentId": "210767d7-23ae-4ba1-82b1-5eb43f453e36"
              },
              {
                "SegmentId": "058754ca-3a1a-416e-a946-ba4ed8a5508d"
              },
              {
                "SegmentId": "58a108d1-b92e-43d5-a58e-f579e7ea205d"
              }
            ],
            "SummarizedSegment": "The patient also discussed their father's death and the role they took on during his illness, keeping a notebook of appointments and medications."
          },
          {
            "EvidenceLinks": [
              {
                "SegmentId": "073784f0-82a9-4f07-a564-1f5c28e7d9f7"
              },
              {
                "SegmentId": "ff073335-5ccd-4095-b63a-0d602d5d07ce"
              },
              {
                "SegmentId": "592c6d47-43f2-4ed3-bdfb-dc906e843837"
              }
            ],
            "SummarizedSegment": "They describe feeling guilty about talking about their grief, noting that their father was the one who was sick."
          },
          {
            "EvidenceLinks": [
              {
                "SegmentId": "2915429a-69f3-4b38-b158-ab291eb3dde9"
              },
              {
                "SegmentId": "7e426f6e-0d5d-4b38-8924-283a6a674973"
              },
              {
                "SegmentId": "4130703a-b620-4b8e-8c71-d21372c765a9"
              }
            ],
            "SummarizedSegment": "The patient reports missing their father most when something practical happens and wanting to call him."
          },
          {
            "EvidenceLinks": [
              {
                "SegmentId": "bf6b6fa0-7433-4102-b14e-6de836e75e60"
              },
              {
                "SegmentId": "01103d59-d20f-4974-a909-eb3de9938bb3"
              }
            ],
            "SummarizedSegment": "They typically push these feelings down and get busy with work.\n"
          }
        ]
